is evolution of  what was once can  the People's Party - now the party of  Wall Street and party of war yep great  book we interviewed Thomas Frank not too  long ago we've been speaking with rocky  Anderson former two-term mayor of Salt  Lake City thanks so much for talking to  me today great to be with you thanks a  lot

